    {
      "id": "jUGE",
      "code_hash": "c6aba109de98e2414eac3e6ff9b4fce3",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"natural-frequencies-and-mode-shapes\">Natural frequencies and mode shapes</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We compute the natural frequencies solving the generalized eigenvalue problem</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\\boldsymbol{k} \\boldsymbol{X} = \\omega^2 \\boldsymbol{m}\\boldsymbol{X},||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">using the <a href=\"https://scipy.org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SciPy</a> function <a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy-1.18.0/reference/generated/scipy.linalg.eigh.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">scipy.linalg.eigh</a>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lMuQ",
      "code_hash": "9fe4ac736292477faafeeb3afd82dc6f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "JSJX",
      "code_hash": "51b5e9ff539b7fb0a18a2de78936cb12",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"squares-of-the-natural-frequencies-rads2\">Squares of the natural frequencies (rad/s)\u00b2</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_1^2 = 0.861||)</marimo-tex>, &nbsp; &nbsp;<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_2^2 = 1.584||)</marimo-tex>, &nbsp; &nbsp;<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_3^2 = 3.055||)</marimo-tex></span>\n<h3 id=\"natural-frequencies-rads\">Natural frequencies (rad/s)</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_1 = 0.928||)</marimo-tex>, &nbsp; &nbsp;<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_2 = 1.259||)</marimo-tex>, &nbsp; &nbsp;<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega_3 = 1.748||)</marimo-tex></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SljO",
      "code_hash": "e9f831ab6c2ec600d3940ed538f4d2ab",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"modal-shapes\">Modal shapes</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Modal shapes are normalized to norm 1.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(X^{(1)} =||)</marimo-tex> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\begin{bmatrix} 0.196 \\\\ 0.223 \\\\ 0.536 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}||)</marimo-tex> &nbsp; &nbsp; <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(X^{(2)} =||)</marimo-tex> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\begin{bmatrix} -0.812 \\\\ -0.338 \\\\ 0.193 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}||)</marimo-tex> &nbsp; &nbsp; <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(X^{(3)} =||)</marimo-tex> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\begin{bmatrix} -0.549 \\\\ 0.580 \\\\ -0.094 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}||)</marimo-tex> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "OXyx",
      "code_hash": "df42195e701defd87a1fb35b35277f11",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"graphical-representation\">Graphical representation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Please understand that these shapes are drawn only to for a quick visual assessment of the relative magnitudes. These values may represent displacements, rotations or other degrees of freedom, and most likely aren't even in the same direction.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
